    <p class="bhd-page__kicker">Choosing the right context</p>
    <h2>Hydration is not one problem with one answer</h2>
    <p>A long endurance event, a hot work shift, an ordinary office day, rehabilitation and clinical dehydration are different situations. The amount and type of fluid that makes sense can differ substantially between them.</p>
    <p>Use the application pages to match the hydration discussion to the situation instead of treating the same advice as universal.</p>
  </article>
